  "asyncapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Gremion kernel API: identity events (IDT)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "TASK-080-a. Events of the kernel API (bodies, org units, seats, wahlperioden, persons, memberships, tenures), written through enqueue(tx) into idt.outbox in the same transaction as the state change and relayed to the IDT stream. Subject: gremion.{tenantId}.idt.<aggregate>.<event>; CloudEvents type de.gremion.idt.<aggregate>.<event>.v1 (DOMAIN s.1). Payloads carry ids and minimal data only (TRD-154); aggregate_version is added to every payload by enqueue. Published ONLY by the nats-auth identity kernel-api. grant.*, branding.*, importjob.*, customersetting.*, person.profilechanged/erased, tenure.release-changed and wahlperiode.corrected are later tasks (081, 130, ops chain) and are not declared here."
  },
